Z||000000||Taijiguy||05-17-2001||11:47 AM||||A guy who lives across the street from me has an odd collection of Fiero parts that he drives around. I haven't walked up to it, they don't seem overly friendly, but this is what I've seen:<BR>White with silver ground f/x. It's a coupe, with a coupe rubber bumpered fascia. The catch is it has GT nameplates, sail panels (coupe remember) and dual exhaust. Wing, and 14" tech wheels. OK, I'd say 85 GT with a coupe nose, <B>but</B> <I>it has the smooth moldings.</I><BR>Things that make you go, "Hmmmmmmm......"<BR>||||reg||1
